{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093780/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.poster.avif?t=1761559464\" width=700 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093780/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.webm?t=1761559464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093780/extras/f018d0f1c1c398efcb368931c876af1f.mp4?t=1761559464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>MEET LUNA!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a quiet, shy girl, Halloween changed her forever. The spell of the moon's dark side bewitched her heart, and now, instead of a modest wallflower, you face a witch: mysterious, daring, and wildly seductive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to conquer this sorceress? You'll have to take a risk! One wrong move, and you might fall victim to her spells. But if you're brave enough to endure the trials of the year's scariest night, Luna will open up to you\u2014free, passionate, and shining with the beauty of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093780/extras/13ff10285fa6df2ed932c3be3397e596.webp?t=1761559464\" width=633 height=43 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>WHAT ELSE DO YOU GET?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By purchasing this DLC, you'll unlock witchy Luna as your mascot! You can switch mascots anytime by opening the &quot;Mascot&quot; tab on the home screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also receive 10,000 Gold, 100 Rubies and 10 Common Mystic Tomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>